installWidget signature change: add `String origin = 'catalog'`.

`AppsStore`: JsAppInfo gains `installSource`. listApps attaches from meta. Meta read already happens at the end (prune). Read once at top too? Currently `_readInstalled()` called only in the gone-branch. I'll read it once at the start (cheap single small file read per scan — acceptable) and reuse for prune.

Careful with the cache gate: attach installSource AFTER cache retrieval: build per-id: `cached.withInstallSource(source)` — but that allocates a new JsAppInfo each scan... fine (cheap; only when source differs? simpler: always copy). Actually keep it simple: copy when `cached.installSource != source`.

